text = "Hello dad. I mean hello sir Papa dad, Seal.. Mc Seal Son. I'm your son, I mean Son Mc Seal Son. I'm here to request therapy payout as I very miss my dad. He is always at work. We never go on vacation. Mom gets mad because dad is always at work and she misses dad. And I miss dad too. Would be nice if he brought me to vacation where we would play ball. I miss my dad. Please let's go on vacation."
